1
00:00:00,870 --> 00:00:04,170
(Raj:)- How's your burrito?
- Still a little frozen in the middle.

2
00:00:04,373 --> 00:00:08,473
(Raj:)Probably because I didn't read the instructions.
No wrapper's gonna tell me what to do.

3
00:00:08,677 --> 00:00:11,207
Unless his name is Jay Z.

4
00:00:12,014 --> 00:00:14,644
- Is something going on?
- What do you mean?

5
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:17,320
(Lucy:)Well, you're acting all weird,
and I'm pretty weird...

6
00:00:17,519 --> 00:00:20,319
(Lucy:)...so I think I know what I'm talking about.

7
00:00:20,522 --> 00:00:24,652
(Raj:)I don't know, maybe it's all those
steroids I've been taking.

8
00:00:26,028 --> 00:00:29,488
(Lucy:)I think I'm gonna go. Thank you
for the burrito and the pork rinds...

9
00:00:29,698 --> 00:00:34,158
(Lucy:)...and the 20-minute lecture on why
monster trucks are better than regular trucks.

10
00:00:34,370 --> 00:00:35,740
(Raj:)Wait, wait.

11
00:00:37,373 --> 00:00:40,533
(Raj:)I found your blog
where you wrote about me.

12
00:00:41,210 --> 00:00:45,510
Oh. I just write that for myself.
I didn't think anybody actually read it.

13
00:00:45,681 --> 00:00:49,411
(Raj:)No kidding. You didn't make it easy to find.
I spent hours digging around online.

14
00:00:51,053 --> 00:00:54,213
(Raj:)For the record, you have excellent credit
and your diabetic aunt...

15
00:00:54,423 --> 00:00:59,023
(Raj:)...seems to be adjusting to her new leg
just fine.

